MyCar for Psion Series 5

Install all files under the system\apps in a directory called \MyCar\
(just as you do with all normal programs).

Start up MyCar and create your own file.  If you want to test MyCar first and enter a number of transactions to see what it does, pls begin somewhere in the past and enter your transactions chronologically. MyCar only allows entries dated between the last entry date and the date of today (no future transactions, no transactions prior to the last one).

UPGRADING from MyCar on the Series 3:
There is no upgrade option for S3 MyCar files. You will either have to start from scratch or enter your S3 data manually (take care variable and fixed costs data are entered chronologically!).

FREEWARE:
This program is freeware.
I would appreciate your reporting of any bugs you may find.

